0..62 Comment "/// This source states function extensionality for data types."
63..66 Comment "///"
67..146 Comment "/// Two functions agree when they return the same result for every constructor."
147..217 Comment "/// The constructor fields provide fresh arguments for the comparison."
218..221 Comment "///"
222..293 Comment "/// The checker proves each pointwise equality by the data definitions."
294..356 Comment "/// `Path.funext` turns those comparisons into function paths."
